msgid ""
"Join our [mailing list](https://mail.kde.org/mailman/listinfo/kstars-devel);"
msgstr ""
"Aliĝu al nia [dissendolisto](https://mail.kde.org/mailman/listinfo/kstars-"
"devel);"

#: content/get-involved.md:19
msgid ""
"Hang out on our [KStars Web Chat](https://webchat.kde.org/#/room/#kstars:kde."
"org) channel;"
msgstr ""
"Kunvenu ĉe nia [KStars Web Chat](https://webchat.kde.org/#/room/#kstars:kde."
"org) kanalo;"

#: content/get-involved.md:20
msgid ""
"Details on building KStars git master are [here](https://invent.kde.org/"
"education/kstars/-/blob/master/README.md);"
msgstr ""
"Detaloj pri konstruado de KStars git master estas [ĉi tie](https://invent."
"kde.org/education/kstars/-/blob/master/README.md);"

#: content/get-involved.md:21
msgid ""
"Some junior and not-so-junior jobs [here](http://techbase.kde.org/Projects/"
"Edu/KStars/JuniorJobs)!"
msgstr ""
"Kelkaj junulaj kaj ne tiom junulaj laboroj [ĉi tie](http://techbase.kde.org/"
"Projects/Edu/KStars/JuniorJobs)!"

