msgid ""
"[Git repository](https://invent.kde.org/education/kstars) — hosts the latest "
"code of KStars"
msgstr ""
"[Git-deponejo](https://invent.kde.org/education/kstars) — gastigas la plej "
"novan kodon de KStars"

